/* ================================================================
   LOGIN SCREEN + LOADING SCREENS — ELITE REDESIGN
   
   Login: confidence, not timidity. The institution and platform
   identity need weight. The card needs warmth against the dark bg.
   The CTA needs authority.
   
   Second loading screen (app-loading-splash): was a blank warm-white
   rectangle with a tiny mark. Replaced with the same dark navy as
   the primary splash — continuous brand experience across the
   auth → loading → app transition.
================================================================ */


/* ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
   I. LOGIN SCREEN
════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */

/* Background: deeper, richer than #04111f */
