/* ================================================================
   §08  GLOBAL CONTRAST + VIBRANCY LIFT
   
   The app is reading as faint across all areas. Root causes:
   1. nm-text2/text3/text4 are too washed out
   2. nm-border is rgba(0,0,0,.07) — nearly invisible
   3. Card backgrounds too close to canvas (#fdfcfb vs #f5f4f0)
