/* ================================================================
   §27  COMPREHENSIVE BUG FIX PASS
   
   Issues found in systematic audit:
   
   1.  --nm-navy = #07111f — used in sidebar, sm-modal btns, calendar
       today highlight, dropdown. Update via #app variable override.
   2.  --nm-navy2 = #0f2d54 — used in avatar status dot border
   3.  --nm-navy3 = #162b48 — minor
   4.  nm-header hardcoded #07111f — news/comms modal header
   5.  Hardcoded #0f2d54 in: rp-nav, rp-detail-head, udd-header,
       staff-table-av, abs-tl-av, nm-av, udd-assign-cta, oncall tab bar
   6.  Hardcoded #0d1b2e in: ops-left
   7.  32 remaining hardcoded old-navy instances in HTML
   8.  --text-4 = #c8c7c1 — far too faint, used in 15+ places
   9.  --text-3 = old value (partially fixed via nm-text3)
   10. font-family:monospace (bare) instead of DM Mono
   11. .58rem font sizes (≈9.3px) — 6 inline occurrences
   12. var(--blue) = #2563eb in style10 — 301 usages, fine but
       should coexist with clinical blue system
   13. Avatar colours inconsistent — attending avatars all #0f2d54
   14. Empty/nil states too faint
   15. var(--text-4) faint in oncall-shift-label, form-help,
       dept-tbl-code, breadcrumb-sep, rot-connector
