/* ================================================================
   §22  PUBLICATIONS — Flat List Rows (remove card wrapping)
   
   Posts should be flat editorial rows separated by hairline dividers,
   not individual cards. The left accent blade (4px coloured stripe)
   is the only visual type indicator needed.
   
   Design: Linear issue list / Notion database list aesthetic.
   Each row is full-width, white background, divider below.
   No border-radius, no box-shadow, no individual card border.
   The list itself sits on the warm canvas.
