/* ================================================================
   §22 + §23  PUBLICATIONS LIST + NEWS DRAWER
   
   LIST ISSUES:
   1. news-card-left: grey thumbnail placeholder showing for highlights
      → hide it; accent is on border-left
   2. Row spacing: too loose for short posts → adaptive padding
   3. Highlight rows: cream background too subtle → slightly warmer
   4. Expired date in amber: needs icon treatment
   5. Right column actions: better structure
   6. Title hover colour: match accent by type
   
   DRAWER ISSUES:
   7. nrd-update-body: amber background too faint (.08) → more presence
   8. nrd-footer buttons: white btn-secondary on near-black → styled for dark
   9. Next/Prev nav: barely visible → proper button treatment
   10. nrd-drawer background: update to match clinical blue system
   11. nrd-hdr: cleaner header
   12. nrd-type-badge: match clinical colours
   13. nrd-title: remove any text-transform forcing
   14. Content width: 65ch is good, keep
   15. Archive button: amber warning treatment
================================================================ */


