/* ================================================================
   §33  STAFF PHOTO AVATAR SUPPORT
   
   index__83_.html adds public_photo_url image rendering inside:
   - .pd-avatar (profile drawer)
   - .scc-initials container (medical staff compact view)
   
   The img inherits container sizing but needs object-fit:cover
   and border-radius to match the circular avatar shape.
================================================================ */

