/* ================================================================
   §50  ROTATION ORBS — TEXT BLEED FIX
   
   Bug: orb labels bleeding outside pill boundaries when track
   is too narrow. Cause: rot-track has overflow:hidden + nowrap,
   forcing orbs into insufficient space.
   
   Fix: allow orbs to show text correctly with a horizontal
   scroll on the track instead of clipping. Also ensure each
   orb has enough padding to contain its label.
================================================================ */

/* Allow orb track to scroll horizontally instead of clipping */
html #app .rot-track,
.rot-track {
  overflow-x: auto !important;
  overflow-y: visible !important;
  scrollbar-width: none !important;
  -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch !important;
}
html #app .rot-track::-webkit-scrollbar,
.rot-track::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none !important; }

/* Orb: ensure pill has enough room for label */
html #app .rot-orb,
.rot-orb {
  flex-shrink: 0 !important;
  overflow: hidden !important;
  text-overflow: ellipsis !important;
  min-width: 36px !important;
  max-width: 140px !important;
  white-space: nowrap !important;
}

/* Active orb: slightly larger but still capped */
html #app .rot-orb--active,
.rot-orb--active {
  min-width: 44px !important;
  max-width: 160px !important;
}

/* Orb label: must not overflow its parent */
html #app .rot-orb-label,
.rot-orb-label {
  overflow: hidden !important;
  text-overflow: ellipsis !important;
  white-space: nowrap !important;
  max-width: 100% !important;
}

/* Also fix the scheduled orb colour — was #3b82f6 (old blue) 
   from the HTML inline block line 1040 */
html #app .rot-orb--scheduled {
  border-color: #1a4f8a !important;
  color: #1a4f8a !important;
}
html #app .rot-orb--scheduled:hover {
  background: rgba(26,79,138,.07) !important;
  border-color: #1a4f8a !important;
}
html #app .rot-compact .rot-orb--scheduled {
  background: #1a4f8a !important;
  color: #fff !important;
  border: none !important;
}


/* ================================================================
   §51  UNIVERSAL OVERFLOW / OVERLAP FIX — ALL MODULES
   
   Root cause: many containers have overflow:hidden on flex rows
   where children use white-space:nowrap. When children are wider
   than the container, text bleeds rather than truncating cleanly.
   
   Fix strategy per context:
   - Text labels in fixed-width containers → ellipsis truncation
   - Orb/pill tracks → horizontal scroll (invisible scrollbar)
   - Tooltip anchors → z-index + pointer-events fix
   - Absolute children of overflow:hidden → restructure to relative
================================================================ */


