/* ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
   §69  PROFILE AS PREMIUM CENTERED MODAL
   The side drawer constrained the profile to a narrow column. This
   converts it into a large, centered modal with generous space so the
   hero, vitals, and activity-led content can breathe. The backdrop
   dims+blurs the app behind it. Fully responsive: it becomes a
   full-screen sheet on phones/tablets so nothing is cramped or hidden.
════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */

/* Backdrop: dim + blur the app behind the modal */
html body #app .profile-drawer-backdrop {
